Status in the minibuffer, stacked two rows: identity over context.
The bar itself is composed by engine/setup from the order file; here
only package install plus mini-modeline display variables. Never
enabled at load: the loader enables it at boot end, after the
dashboard lands and before the done message, so boot logging stays
in *Messages*.

** Config :config:
#+begin_src emacs-lisp
;; Forward declarations first: the package loads later via
;; straight; bare defvars keep the byte-compiler quiet without
;; rebinding anything once it does.
(defvar mini-modeline-l-format)
(defvar mini-modeline-r-format)
(defvar mini-modeline-truncate-p)
(defvar mini-modeline-update-interval)
(defvar mini-modeline-echo-duration)
(defvar mini-modeline-echo-position)
(defvar mini-modeline-hide-mode-line)
(defvar mini-modeline-enhance-visual)
(defvar mini-modeline-right-padding)
(defvar mini-modeline-face-attr)
(require 'mini-modeline)
(setq mini-modeline-l-format '((:eval (manifolding-modeline--side 'left)))
      mini-modeline-r-format '((:eval (manifolding-modeline--side 'right)))
      mini-modeline-truncate-p nil
      mini-modeline-update-interval 1.0
      mini-modeline-echo-duration 2
      mini-modeline-echo-position "left"
      mini-modeline-hide-mode-line t
      mini-modeline-enhance-visual t
      mini-modeline-right-padding 3
      mini-modeline-face-attr '(:background "#000000" :foreground "#FFFFFF"))
#+end_src
